    <div style="background:#10233d;padding:20px;border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:20px;border:1px solid #33415c;border-left:4px solid #22d3ee;">
    <h3 style="color:#c5cae9;margin-top:0;">🔭 Business Background</h3>
    <p><strong>Coordination activities:</strong> rope skipping, ball bouncing and dribbling, catching and throwing, hopscotch, juggling, dance steps and clapping patterns. <strong>Strength activities:</strong> push-ups, squats, sit-ups, lunges, wall sits, carrying safe loads and tug of war. <strong>With music:</strong> doing steps or exercises to the beat of a song improves rhythm and coordination and makes exercise enjoyable. <strong>Safety:</strong> always warm up (light jogging, stretching), use correct form, increase effort gradually, drink water and cool down. <strong>Benefits:</strong> healthy heart and muscles, better performance in sports and dance, good posture, and reduced risk of lifestyle diseases such as obesity, diabetes and high blood pressure.</p>
    </div>
